---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Terms of Use — Fixoraa" description="Fixoraa's terms of use: free tools and games provided as-is, fair use, intellectual property and acceptable use.">
<main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-10 sm:py-14">
  <div class="text-center mb-10">
    <span class="inline-block text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-widest px-4 py-1.5 rounded-full text-white bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FF5A5F] via-[#F43F8E] to-[#9333EA] mb-4">Legal</span>
    <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-black tracking-tight text-neutral-900">Terms of <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-[#FF5A5F] via-[#F43F8E] to-[#9333EA] bg-clip-text text-transparent">Use</span></h1>
    <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-neutral-500">Last updated: September 30, 2026</p>
  </div>

  <article class="space-y-8 text-neutral-700 leading-relaxed">
    <section>
      <p class="text-lg text-neutral-800">Welcome to Fixoraa. By using this website and its free tools and games, you agree to these terms. They're written in plain English, and the gist is simple: <strong class="text-neutral-900">use the tools freely and fairly, and don't break things.</strong></p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-neutral-900 mb-3">1. Free use</h2>
      <p>Every tool and game on Fixoraa is free for personal and commercial use, with no signup, no usage limits and no watermarks. You don't need our permission to use a tool for your work, your business or your homework.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-neutral-900 mb-3">2. Provided "as is" — no warranty</h2>
      <p>Our tools are provided as-is, without warranties of any kind. We build and test them carefully, but we can't guarantee that every result is correct, complete or suitable for your specific situation. Calculators and converters are meant as helpful guides, not as professional financial, legal, medical or tax advice — for important decisions, please consult a qualified professional of your own. We are not liable for any loss or damage arising from your use of the site or its outputs.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-neutral-900 mb-3">3. Fair use</h2>
      <p>You're welcome to use the tools as much as you like in the normal course of life and work. Please don't hammer the site with automated scripts, scrapers or bots at a rate that degrades the service for everyone else. If a tool offers AI-powered features, don't abuse them to generate spam or harmful content.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-neutral-900 mb-3">4. Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>The Fixoraa name, this website's design, copy and code are ours — please don't copy the site wholesale, rebrand it as your own, or imply you're affiliated with us. What you create <em>with</em> the tools, on the other hand, is entirely yours: passwords you generate, text you convert, invoices you build, scores you earn — do whatever you want with them, no credit required (though it's always appreciated).</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-neutral-900 mb-3">5. Acceptable use</h2>
      <p>Don't use Fixoraa to do anything unlawful, to infringe anyone else's rights, to distribute malware, or to interfere with the site's operation or other users' enjoyment of it. We may restrict access for anyone who does.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-neutral-900 mb-3">6. Third-party links</h2>
      <p>Some pages may link to external websites. We have no control over those sites and aren't responsible for their content or practices.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-neutral-900 mb-3">7. Changes to these terms</h2>
      <p>We may update these terms from time to time as the site grows. The "Last updated" date at the top will always tell you when they last changed, and continued use of the site after an update means you accept the new terms.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-neutral-900 mb-3">8. Contact us</h2>
      <p>Questions about these terms? Reach us at <a href="mailto:official@fixoraa.tech" class="font-semibold text-[#9333EA] hover:underline">official@fixoraa.tech</a> or via our <a href="/contact" class="font-semibold text-[#9333EA] hover:underline">contact page</a>.</p>
    </section>
  </article>
</main>
</Layout>
